Ah.

> So the definition of final club has to preclude some
> sets of membership rules like the one above to be
> a real definition.

True.  However, the aim is not to find out in what
situations the list of final clubs can be determined,
but simply to get a non-circular definition of "final
club" against the set of cases where it is meaningful.
 
